the n0 is slope 1 cycle=on range=audio
the n1 is choruslite 1 samplerate=quarter
the n2 is burst count=0.255
the n3 is svf samplerate=eighth
the n4 is lowpass samplerate=quarter cutoff=0.726
the n5 is comb att.pitch=-1.06
the n6 is saw 3
the n7 is attenuverter
n1 -> n0
n7 -> n0.rise
n6 -> n0.fall
n1 -> n1.depth
n7 -> n1.depth
n5 -> n3
n5 => n3
n2 -> n3.cutoff
n7 ~> n3.res
n4.band -> n4
n1 -> n4.res
play >| n5
value 10 -> n5.pitch
n4.band -> n5.decay
n5 ~> n7.offset
n1 -> out
n2 -> left
n5 -> right
n7 -> out
